              "type": "boolean",
              "serializationType": "boolean"
            }
          }
        },
        "serializationType": "map"
      },
      "data": {
        "0": {
          "json": {
            "name": "The Impossible Dimension",
            "description": "🌲 Step into Chiri’s home world and discover \"The Impossible Dimension\" a growing multiverse where nature, technology & a gentle touch of magic live in harmony 🔮🌲\n\nJoin Chiri, a curious explorer, as we reveal new chapters of the story through weekly live streams, quests, wearable drops, art showcases, and community hangouts inside Chiri's world in Decentraland. 🔮\n\n🗺️ Throughout these events, we will share as the world evolves: new areas will open, stories will unfold, and Chiri's universe will transcend digital and physical realms nurtured with tender & the power of community.\n\n🎁 From 3D wearables and NFT art to physical collectibles and educational workshops.\n\n🎮 Expect Chiri storytelling 🎥 creative process streams 🎨 guest artist interviews 🖼️ collabs 🪄 Chiri Store drops 🎶 live music 📻 wearable drops 👘 cozy community moments that connect digital and physical universes & more!\n\nOur community is inclusive, kind, and playful 💫 everyone is welcome. Let’s open this portal together! 🌈",
            "thumbnail": "assets/scene/Images/chiri_logoooooooooooo.jpg",
            "ageRating": "A",
            "categories": [
              "art",
              "game",
              "social"
            ],
            "author": "Impossible Studio",
            "email": "impossible.studio.contact@gmail.com",
